# Licence and third-party exceptions

Original code, documentation, author-compiled measurements and other original
materials in this release are distributed under Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), except for the third-party material identified
below. See https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode .

Third-party data are not relicensed under CC BY 4.0. Opponent-ranking metadata
extracted from Jeff Sackmann / Tennis Abstract match records and the comparator
columns derived from the Kaggle ATP matches dataset retain the upstream
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode .

The Kaggle dataset explicitly credits Jeff Sackmann and Tennis Abstract. Its
API licence field is "Other (specified in description)"; this release does not
interpret that field as a grant of unrestricted rights. Upstream attribution
and non-commercial/share-alike conditions are retained for these source-derived
records. Exact provenance and scope are documented in data/README.md.

The six full upstream yearly match CSVs are not redistributed in this ZIP.
analysis/fetch_opponent_sources.py optionally downloads the pinned, hash-checked
copies into outputs/third_party/opponent_sources. This does not change their
licence. The original upstream README and download manifest are retained.

No rights over third-party match footage are granted; no match footage is
included. These notices distinguish original author material from third-party
source records and do not assert ownership over the latter.
